// 我的页只铺最近 10 条：历史会一直变长，全量渲染会把这一页拖慢（BeanShell 下更明显）
public void mine_history(LinearLayout host) {
	JSONArray arr = null;
	try {
		i.fn("store");
		arr = st_progressSorted();
	} catch (Throwable t) {
	}
	if (arr == null || arr.length() == 0) {
		TextView empty = ui_text("还没有阅读记录", 13, th_ink2());
		LinearLayout.LayoutParams elp = new LinearLayout.LayoutParams(-1, -2);
		elp.topMargin = ui_dp(12);
		empty.setLayoutParams(elp);
		host.addView(empty);
		return;
	}

	int show = 10;
	if (arr.length() < show) {
		show = arr.length();
	}
	for (int k = 0; k < show; k++) {
		JSONObject o = arr.optJSONObject(k);
		if (o != null) {
			host.addView(mine_histRow(o));
		}
	}
	if (arr.length() > show) {
		host.addView(mine_moreRow(arr.length()));
	}
}

// 「查看全部」：整条记录一个不少，但要进独立页看，不占「我的」的建页时间
public View mine_moreRow(int total) {
	LinearLayout row = ui_row();
	row.setGravity(Gravity.CENTER_VERTICAL);
	row.setPadding(ui_dp(20), ui_dp(14), ui_dp(20), ui_dp(14));
	row.setLayoutParams(new LinearLayout.LayoutParams(-1, -2));

	TextView t = ui_text("查看全部", 15, th_accent());
	row.addView(t, new LinearLayout.LayoutParams(0, -2, 1f));

	TextView c = ui_text("共 " + total + " 条", 13, th_ink2());
	row.addView(c);

	row.setOnClickListener(new View.OnClickListener() {
		public void onClick(View v) {
			i.uigo("history.iyu");
		}
	});
	wg_ripple(row, 0, false);

	LinearLayout wrap = ui_col();
	wrap.addView(row, new LinearLayout.LayoutParams(-1, -2));
	wrap.addView(wg_hairline(), new LinearLayout.LayoutParams(-1, 1));
	return wrap;
}

public View mine_histRow(JSONObject p) {
	LinearLayout row = ui_row();
	row.setGravity(Gravity.CENTER_VERTICAL);
	row.setPadding(ui_dp(20), ui_dp(14), ui_dp(20), ui_dp(14));
	row.setLayoutParams(new LinearLayout.LayoutParams(-1, -2));

	String title = p.optString("title", "");
	String author = p.optString("author", "");
	if (title.length() == 0) {
		title = "未记录书名";
	}
	if (author.length() > 0) {
		title = title + " · " + author;
	}
	TextView t = ui_text(title, 15, th_ink1());
	t.setSingleLine(true);
	t.setEllipsize(TextUtils.TruncateAt.END);
	row.addView(t, new LinearLayout.LayoutParams(0, -2, 1f));

	TextView meta = ui_text(p.optInt("page", 1) + " / " + p.optInt("pageAll", 1), 13, th_ink2());
	row.addView(meta);

	JSONObject picked = p;
	row.setOnClickListener(new View.OnClickListener() {
		public void onClick(View v) {
			try {
				i.sss("reader.surl", picked.optString("surl", ""));
				i.sss("reader.title", picked.optString("title", ""));
				// 作者也要带过去：漏了的话阅读页会沿用上一个 i.sss 里的旧作者，再存回进度里
				i.sss("reader.author", picked.optString("author", ""));
				i.uigo("reader.iyu");
			} catch (Throwable t) {
			}
		}
	});
	wg_ripple(row, 0, false);

	LinearLayout wrap = ui_col();
	wrap.addView(row, new LinearLayout.LayoutParams(-1, -2));
	wrap.addView(wg_hairline(), new LinearLayout.LayoutParams(-1, 1));
	return wrap;
}
